<newsitem itemid="21196" id="root" date="1996-08-29" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Don Group returns to profit in year.</title>
<headline>Don Group returns to profit in year.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30 vs 16 months to June 30, 1995</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     30.39	 vs 17.38 loss</p>
<p>    Shr, pre-excps (cts)  21.24	 vs 18.11</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  4.0	  vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Net profit		 8.52	 vs 3.47 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    8.49	 vs 3.15 loss</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.26	 vs 0.62</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    6.49	 vs 1.47</p>
<p>    Exceptional gain	 2.56	 vs 7.09 charge</p>
<p>    Share of associates'   0.29	 vs 0.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		  67.67	 vs 37.64</p>
<p>Div payable October 16</p>
<p>on register September 13</p>
<p>Full name: The Don Group Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The hotel group said shareholders would be offered 1.05 capitalisation shares for every 100 held in lieu of the cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
